This patch is applied to the pinned Morpher_CGRA_Mapper checkout at
9a9dce7aea521f1d5ef33686f57ca84864edb3c9.  The source checkout is vendored
under this revision's patch directory (its upstream .git metadata is not
available in the artifact), so the exact post-patch file digests are recorded
in PATCH_MANIFEST.md.

Changes:
* util.h: add --seed (non-negative int, default 0) and propagate
  `random_seed`/`has_random_seed` into arguments.
* CGRA_xml_compiler.cpp: call SAMapper::setRandomSeed for mapping method 1
  and print the selected seed.
* SimulatedAnnealingMapper.h: add a seeded mt19937 and setter; route
  acceptance random draws through it when seeded, retaining rand() behavior
  when absent.
* SimulatedAnnealingMapper.cpp: route node/parent selection and destination
  shuffling through the seeded generator; random_device/time remain only on the
  explicitly unseeded compatibility path.

No mapper objective, annealing schedule, move ordering, or architecture
semantics were changed.
